OL,3,AGujarat riots gang-rape survivor
OL,4,A'heartbroken' after bail for two
OL,5,Aconvicts
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe article has details that some
OL,8,Freaders may find disturbing
OL,10,FA pregnant Muslim woman who was
OL,11,Fgang-raped and saw 14 family members
OL,12,Fmurdered during the 2002 Gujarat riots
OL,13,Fhas spoken of her "pain, shock and
OL,14,Fdisbelief" after two of her rapists
OL,15,Fwere recently granted bail.
OL,17,FBilkis Bano said in a statement that
OL,18,Fshe heard about the top court order
OL,19,Fthrough press reports and vowed to
OL,20,Ffight back.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
